 gravity of drug policy. Speaking one's mind on such matters can feel like biting one's **tongue**, especially when the rules change so abruptly.\n\nP.P.S The shift in legislation marks a significant turning point for the region.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Oregon", "logprob": -1.192093e-07}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": -0.002305242}, {"token": " pioneering", "logprob": -0.013684255}, {"token": " effort", "logprob": -0.28068212}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " dec", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "riminal", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "ize", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " drug", "logprob": -0.29459623}, {"token": " possession", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " ends", "logprob": -0.15838815}, {"token": " this", "logprob": -5.2452224e-06}, {"token": " Sunday", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.09373259}, {"token": " replaced", "logprob": -4.172334e-06}, {"token": " by", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " legislation", "logprob": -0.0005835805}, {"token": " that", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " restores", "logprob": -3.2582428}, {"token": " criminal", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " penalties", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " for", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " holding", "logprob": -2.3841887e-06}, {"token": " small", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " quantities", "logprob": -0.00018938188}, {"token": " of", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " hard", "logprob": -0.0003479132}, {"token": " substances", "logprob": -1.192093e-07}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -5.3644326e-06}, {"token": " Under", "logprob": -0.0032930893}, {"token": " the", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " new", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " statute", "logprob": -0.00027964448}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.0003086805}, {"token": " individuals", "logprob": -0.21485686}, {"token": " found", "logprob": -0.29455155}, {"token": " with", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " f", "logprob": -0.28254712}, {"token": "entanyl", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ",", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " heroin", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ",", "logprob": 0.0}, 